================================================================================
USER DATA NOTICE
================================================================================

This application processes user voice input on-device only. No audio,
transcript, or wondering log entry leaves the user's device unless the
user explicitly invokes the JSON export feature and chooses where to save
the output file. The application has zero network entitlements
(`com.apple.security.network.client` and `network.server` are NOT set
in the application sandbox configuration).

If the user enables Child Mode, additional COPPA-compliant safeguards
apply per `runs/2026-05-05-spec/spec/data-flow-diagram.md`. Auto-detection
of child mode is performed against on-device classification only and the
classification result is stored only with verifiable parental consent
acquired prior to first save.

